{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：20:00 2026-08-18 HKT</p>\n\n<p>43歲的2003年港姐冠軍曹敏莉自2010年嫁給金融才俊張家傑後便淡出幕前，誕下一女二子。近日曹敏莉在社交平台上載了與15歲大女Dora在機場的溫馨合照。不少網民起初以為Dora即將到海外留學，但實際上，她今次並非出國，而是按其就讀的國際學校規定，啟程前往杭州參與為期一年的Year 10住宿課程。雖然不用遠赴歐美，但對於一位年僅15歲、從未試過長期離開母親生活的女孩來說，這仍是一個充滿挑戰的獨立考驗，曹敏莉在照片中感觸地寫下「ALL the best in HZ~Year 10」及「I Miss you Dora」，字裡行間流露出強烈的不捨。</p>\n<h2>曹敏莉女兒赴杭州住宿讀書</h2>\n<p>照片中，曹敏莉女兒Dora已經長得亭亭玉立，兩母女並肩留影時，擁有一身健康小麥色肌膚與清純長直髮的Dora，身高早已超越媽媽，高䠷身形相當搶眼。以往外界常指Dora的五官輪廓似足爸爸，但隨着年紀漸長，她逐漸褪去了爸爸的影子，反而完美遺傳了媽咪標致的尖下巴，如今的Dora五官越發精緻立體，氣質優雅，網民紛紛表示基因強大。</p>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉為2003年港姐冠軍，亞軍為楊洛婷，季軍為戚黛黛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d635425511f1ece8d7830eb7f406c0cc/2023-06/M4_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉參選時被視為大熱。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/20eba8de76b1282f6c9b53ab888d8089/2024-02/DCENT16123082003.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉當選後有拍劇，但產量不算多，其中一套是《胭脂水粉》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ebb54b0e6be73710d4351bd9a825c943/2023-06/DCENT50412012005.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2007年曾參加湖南電視台舉辦的《舞動奇蹟》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8aabec0d8db9da22aa63b9cdd48acf9a/2023-06/M5_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉15歲女兒已經高過媽媽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/78bb15c0911f80ecd604c0fb33a79f3b/2026-08/SaveClip_App_670250569_18579046057047878_1651866053336177714_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉2010年與金融才俊張家傑結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f840f7b4bce9ee41077ead600aa93da/2023-01/mandy30.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉婚後誕下兩子一女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/223d8b7980e23e412f7d975ad009c746/2024-02/CHO_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉一家五口周遊列國。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8c7566e9f139e7443893e6d2055a3cc9/2024-02/CHO_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉兩度為古巨基拍MV。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e80e1d41ce2751b64e538ef4b698fa0/2025-04/DCENT60328102003.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉（左二）雖然淡出幕前，但積極參與港姐及慧妍活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c80e67ad5bec7621252e1f6d3cf9c751/2023-06/chomandylee_318025078_528645949155841_2520971062864934428_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉（左三）雖然淡出幕前，但積極參與港姐及慧妍活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef5329b7db8484fa2f3a788738a071b7/2023-06/chomandylee_345877807_2448482028652343_3055320664223943289_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉早前於布吉與家人度假中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34ab1e57554f3559bcc382f501178e88/2025-04/chomandylee_1745455344_3617464074759772960_1733871877.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉在IG分享多張照片，留言表示：「Lazy by the pool.」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/756a62f76921c4387622ca2a0fedcfb4/2025-04/chomandylee_1745455344_3617464074768202009_1733871877.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉自拍長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a1e2455765840b28a19288aab7b927d/2025-04/chomandylee_1745455344_3617464074759624820_1733871877.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉與大女就在池邊拍下不少美照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c5b9c4343fc99e89f5680fa4797e5e8/2025-04/chomandylee_1745455344_3617464074751404704_1733871877.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉大女已變美少女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/612b9edf87ab5781c0a5cba7a712fc7a/2025-04/chomandylee_1745455344_3617464075044808915_1733871877.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉大女悉心打扮拍美照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3c5ed1d97a169204c958815fb7d2074/2025-04/chomandylee_1745455344_3617464075044875051_1733871877.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉母子照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/759932a0f1d25f56bdb7dc4ae68fa5a1/2025-04/chomandylee_1745455344_3617464074759659811_1733871877.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉囝囝游水放電。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b70c0c1d54a92cccf8c536f61691f7b/2025-04/chomandylee_1745455344_3617464074768026383_1733871877.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉2010年與金融才俊張家傑結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a10d10f93f35b321e4556e47a0504b52/2023-01/mandy34.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一家五口住在半山豪宅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea62a8ba3178d6af6873870fa256f29b/2023-01/mandy32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉婚後住豪宅做少奶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e97cb60a277728443b7fa9f1be5f57bb/2023-01/mandy36.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉老公張家傑相當擅於投資，她可以安心做闊太。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0eef09e160a73721168ccb690f4f4312/2022-12/unknown_271348978_1109290973162772_3281016801600106324_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉家住千呎複式豪宅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/474ac6b13113069e7ac3bd78db7a8357/2022-12/unknown_273024070_335835255100575_7604663433824379094_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉婚後育有一女兩子，包括大女兒Dora、二仔Marco及細仔Leo。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bab11b17a0e02a6c3606a9cf284c5dd9/2023-01/mandy40.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉三個子女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92fa27a401c4fdb1f68434e45c9156df/2023-01/mandy29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"三姊弟感情極好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e43720512d901a062151e0570b9d0b5/2023-01/mandy28.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉一有時間就帶仔女外遊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84baadcffa8cb03e68ad81b83bda6e46/2023-09/MARCO_60_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉老公是投資銀行高層張家傑（Jacky）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bc099740c18f957207a7e651372b652d/2023-06/chomandylee_339836632_750817269818066_5844476411218808499_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉育有3名子女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bbfd40df509917ffc01964cfea66720e/2023-06/chomandylee_339983838_922121942432763_43820442338124614_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一家五口非常幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/66ce3f273ef35e6219adbec4073c4677/2023-06/chomandylee_340025222_669157025013848_9117267554198623054_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉與老公讓三子女讀全港最貴國際學校，學費達30萬元，留位費都要15萬元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d969a7bd4f2a7adc85c966aa2dec77f/2023-01/mandy18.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉晒出女兒彈琴的影片，不少網民都讚她彈琴流暢悅耳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9dfe28e02eb5721f907c8a196b0bbed/2023-04/VideoScreenshot--MandyLChochomandyleeInstagramphotosandvideos-0%E2%80%9900%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大女Dora曾推出首本英文小說《The Chronicles of An and Ai》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/75625bddd18d450357507cdd46c014e1/2024-02/CHO_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉捧囡囡場之餘，亦落力幫對方宣傳新書。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a4a17bf661b84921b56b861b0262df3/2024-02/CHO_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉大女Dora小學畢業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fcce83a6376de1177da3c4752ca9fa5/2023-06/chomandylee_351682265_663914239114281_5226705510807226778_n%20%281%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"竟然已追及媽媽的高度。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e1169fb9c4d98f9b1f63faa2b341e1d/2023-06/chomandylee_351769023_278385284556180_7763390337439013557_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉與老公一齊到場祝賀女兒畢業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cade126dfb8093d97012281a80ea8e19/2023-06/chomandylee_352149386_586035783598306_5929163063748149096_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"全家與老師合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d8f8f70773db608651aab6e28b1d45f/2023-06/chomandylee_352331527_1285086082143917_4028453513834732917_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉的囡囡擁一雙長腿，笑容又似媽媽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f23ae6aaa7d352d7621096488e70091a/2023-04/mandy_31.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉對兒子Marco悉心栽培。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/73551572e58a4077c5bf1f69dbcab19f/2023-09/MARCO_51_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Marco與家姐Dora感情好好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83d65fb50e28408f2796b4b2ef273478/2023-09/MARCO_5_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>曹敏莉女兒曾出版英文小說</h2>\n<p>曹敏莉女兒Dora不僅外貌出眾，更是一位品學兼優的學生，就讀於漢基國際學校，曹敏莉曾受表示，大女Dora性格較為文靜內斂，自7、8歲起已深深迷上《哈利波特》等奇幻書籍，並立志成為一名作家。Dora熱愛閱讀，更將興趣化為行動，在2023年已成功出版了個人的全英文小說，如今她踏上杭州的住宿求學之旅，小小年紀已經十分獨立。</p>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉婚後為老公誕下兩子一女\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e46e1afa0e2c07acddf330eaa8d9533/2023-09/chomandylee_373371103_296338569762832_5159928869186184129_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉與老公慶祝結婚13周年紀念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7db818d86ca433d3818e40f15b7b6b4/2023-10/MANDY_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉童年與母親合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5de062304007043d488392a80a8d958d/2023-10/12_2_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉與爸爸感情好好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c15a0a169ce5f82594c7bc0fa747e2e/2023-10/MANDY_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉與父母來個double dating。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a18c3745fb6d932b4e389fff8e64d07/2023-10/MANDY_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉是父母眼中的寶貝女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da9e9d07ad3252876c3999e40569aa7e/2023-10/MANDY_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉三姊妹都是靚女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92a40c226aa70d8d6f4830255212d075/2023-10/MANDY_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉的爸爸與女婿都有幾分相似。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3f1d870bedfbeda0b316160a4a12c25/2023-10/MANDY_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉的三個仔女與公公婆婆好似樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/04cdef8be460aa339cbc97b426901d2d/2023-10/MANDY_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉和媽媽同月同日生，更曾一齊慶生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2afcb1339f511d1a25bd74edc54d0001/2025-09/1_9_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉和媽媽慶生，爸爸亦十分靚仔有型。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/535211719aae74b21b497bdcd5eae2e7/2025-09/2_12_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉和媽媽一齊慶生，曹敏莉的兩位姊妹當然列席。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dfdecc6a30992c681a9908a6e330e2dc/2025-09/3_10_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉和媽媽一起吃蛋糕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/360148456ed2033a2bb2cac7cd20c2bf/2025-09/4_8_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉的三名子女和婆婆合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/785ba6e25aae3778a354cdd6727ae060/2025-09/5_6_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉分享珍貴年幼照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10640b91e990ff4f73a0d40b43eb880c/2025-09/6_4_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹媽媽罕有戴上頭巾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e1125bf0859b15a853f13d6dd02d696/2025-05/2_0_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉爸爸和媽媽合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a3dbd3b3471b6377b96290f193fbc11/2025-05/3_0_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹媽媽和曹家三姐妹合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9290f65bcc3f53acfd96870336dffe8c/2025-05/4_0_19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民指曹媽媽的頭髮有點不自然，疑似是假髮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35cfa03e6130e9432e9c7fa4f39ea032/2025-05/5_0_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉的爸爸70歲生日，三代同堂好熱鬧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d77da205218256818f10bd27f2f8dbf/2023-10/MANDY_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉與爸爸合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/984bdab342b3ed1c3cfbdd7015ed316c/2023-10/MANDY_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉的爸爸已經70歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20daeb6f076c535ca596caaac63e9513/2023-10/MANDY_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉的媽媽意外撞樣商天娥。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4a3372c780dd70b5f85c4a402ff90f7/2023-10/MANDY_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏莉與媽媽同為9月壽星。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e77ccbd0b04f367dd30e4e83ad90c897/2023-09/chomandylee_371235322_889825696154771_6825801072526212463_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一家五口有四個靚女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/166f69e330e3d54ede483200e2e920b5/2023-09/chomandylee_372542968_206202575787541_7478096282227084268_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一家人大合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b16359c882cc88cad82c99b449479d8/2023-10/MANDY_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曹敏寶以往也曾晒出三姊妹合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a815d7f1d6bc8ebf198b3e6e39e1f628/2023-09/mable_cho_336072496_726223512304505_8346428706134140428_n.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T12:05:06.568443+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":647,"images":69,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}